<title>USA: U.S. equity options volume in May up 28 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>U.S. equity options volume in May up 28 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. equity options volume in May totalled 21,637,333 contracts, up 28 percent from 16,921,494 in May 1996, the Options Industry Council (OIC) said Wednesday.</p>
<p>The OIC said average daily volume in May was 1,030,349 contracts compared with 974,978 contracts in April.</p>
<p>((--Derivatives desk, 312 408 8750))</p>
